      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0",
      "artist": "G41rn8",
      "description": "Puxian Ge. Jin Dynasty, 1128-1143. Shanhua Si, Datong\nSamantabhadra's Pavilion is three bays on a side, 10m by 10m (33ft by 33ft) square. The two-level tower, currently (2009) under renovation, is topped by a hip-gable roof.",
